.TH bin2hex 1 "2026 November 14" ""

.SH NAME
bin2hex \- Convert binary file to Intel hex

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bin2hex
<input.bin> <output.hex>

.SH COPYRIGHT
CoreLAB is Copyright (C) 2026 by Pozsar Zsolt.

.SH DESCRIPTION
The bin2hex script converts a raw binary format file to an Intel hex file. It
serves as a simple wrapper around the objcopy utility.
.PP
The script is useable on Unix-like operating systems.

.SH FILES
.TP
.B *.bin:
Input file containing raw binary data.
.TP
.B *.hex:
Output file where the converted Intel hex data is saved.

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Normal exit.
.TP
.B 1
Insufficient parameters.
.TP
.B 2
Missing dependency.

.SH HOMEPAGE
.UR https://pozsarzs.github.io/corelab
.UE
.PP
.UR https://github.com/pozsarzs/corelab
.UE

